msgid "**十张超 4K 图，只比同一处细节。**"
msgstr "**Ten images beyond 4K. One detail at native resolution.**"

msgid "在鸟头上画一次框，隐藏原图。十张 4608 × 2592 图像的同一块 160 × 160 像素区域并排铺开，沿鸟喙就能比较不同插值的边缘。"
msgstr "Box the bird’s head once and hide the full images. Compare the same 160 × 160 pixels from ten 4608 × 2592 images, following the edge of the beak across interpolation methods."

msgid "{ref}`跟做 1:1 对比 <native-detail>` [下载无损 PNG](media/sr-detail-native.png)"
msgstr "{ref}`Try the 1:1 comparison <native-detail>` [Download the lossless PNG](media/sr-detail-native.png)"

msgid "在完整窗口内框选鸟头，切换到只显示十个原尺寸局部。"
msgstr "A full-window recording shows how to box the bird’s head and display ten native-resolution crops."

msgid "跟随录屏设置放大框，再下载最终画布的 PNG，按 100% 查看边缘细节。"
msgstr "Follow the recording to set up the magnifier. Download the final canvas as a PNG and view it at 100% to compare edges."

msgid "**点一个位置，挑出一组样本。**"
msgstr "**Pick one position. Keep the matching set.**"

msgid "A、B 两个来源各占一行，每行显示三张。点中 B 行的第二张并保存，A 行的第二张也会一起导出。"
msgstr "Sources A and B each occupy one row of three images. Select the middle image in row B and save to export the middle image from both rows."

msgid "{ref}`跟做并行挑图 <multi-source-picks>`"
msgstr "{ref}`Follow the walkthrough <multi-source-picks>`"

msgid "两行三列显示 A、B 的图像，点中下排中间一张，保存后重新打开两个来源的结果。"
msgstr "Six images in two rows. The middle image in the bottom row is selected, and the saved pair is reopened."

msgid "Per source 设为 1,3。点中 B/02.png，按 Ctrl+S，再打开输出目录核对两张 02.png。"
msgstr "Set Per source to 1,3. Click B/02.png, press Ctrl+S and reopen the output folder to check both copies of 02.png."

