msgid "本页演示开发版功能。正在使用 3.9.7？请查看 [3.9.7 中文手册](https://mulimgviewer.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/docs-v3.9.7-r1/)。"
msgstr "This page previews the development version. Running 3.9.7? See the [archived 3.9.7 manual (Chinese)](https://mulimgviewer.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/docs-v3.9.7-r1/)."

msgid "当前手册版本为 {sub-ref}`release`。[查看 3.9.7 中文手册](https://mulimgviewer.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/docs-v3.9.7-r1/)。"
msgstr "This manual covers version {sub-ref}`release`. [View the archived 3.9.7 manual (Chinese)](https://mulimgviewer.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/docs-v3.9.7-r1/)."

msgid "{ref}`放大同一区域 <compare-details>` 对照两个来源的局部细节"
msgstr "{ref}`Magnify the same region <compare-details>` Compare a detail across two sources"

msgid "Cat 和 Sunset 并排翻页，右侧展开 Input & Playback。"
msgstr "Cat and Sunset advance side by side with Input & Playback visible."

msgid "左格是 Cat，右格是 Sunset。单击下一页，两路同时前进一帧。"
msgstr "Cat is on the left and Sunset on the right. Advance one page to move both clips forward by one frame."

msgid "[下载与安装](resources/install.md) 选择系统对应的桌面包，或从源码安装"
msgstr "[Download and install](resources/install.md) Choose a desktop bundle or install from source"
